## 2. 真名 2：`openclaw plugins`（plural · 不是 `openclaw plugin` singular）

### 2.1 原始命令

```bash
openclaw plugins --help
```

### 2.2 完整原始输出

```
OpenClaw 2026.9.4 (3a9d69d) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.

Usage: openclaw plugins [options] [command]
Manage OpenClaw plugins and extensions

Options:
  -h, --help   Display help for command

Commands:
  build        Build plugin metadata and native Control UI assets
  disable      Disable a plugin in config
  doctor       Report plugin load issues
  enable       Enable a plugin in config
  init         Create a plugin project
  inspect      Inspect plugin details
  install      Install a plugin or hook pack (path, archive, npm spec, git repo,
               clawhub:package, or marketplace entry)
  list         List discovered plugins
  marketplace  Inspect Claude-compatible plugin marketplaces
  pack         Bundle a built plugin into an exact artifact for activation
               approval
  registry     Inspect or rebuild the persisted plugin registry
  search       Search ClawHub plugin packages
  uninstall    Uninstall a plugin
  update       Update installed plugins and tracked hook packs
  validate     Validate plugin metadata and native Control UI assets

Docs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/plugins
```

### 2.3 来源

- 本机 `$ openclaw plugins --help`（2026-09-27 实拉）

### 2.4 勘误对照

| 业界常写 | OpenClaw 真名 | 实证 |
|---|---|---|
| `openclaw plugin` (singular) | **`openclaw plugins` (plural)** | CLI 拒绝 `openclaw plugin --help`，直接显示 `openclaw plugins [options] [command]` |
| `openclaw plugin install` | **`openclaw plugins install`** | `openclaw plugins install --help` 输出确认 |
| 子命令仅 5–8 个 | **15 个子命令**（build / disable / doctor / enable / init / inspect / install / list / marketplace / pack / registry / search / uninstall / update / validate）| 完整清单见上文输出 |

### 2.5 关键 trap

- `install` 子命令**真实存在**（v1.0 调研报告曾误以为不存在）；`plugins install` 同时支持 5 种源：path / archive / npm spec / git repo / clawhub:package / marketplace entry
- `install` **不会自动 enable**——必须额外跑 `plugins enable <id> --accept-capabilities`
- `enable` 必须传 `--accept-capabilities` flag（manifest 升级引入新 capability 时需用户显式接受）

