### 3.4 实证 4（open-prose · skill 字段案例）

#### 完整原始输出

```json
{
  "id": "open-prose",
  "name": "OpenProse",
  "description": "OpenProse VM skill pack with a /prose slash command.",
  "skills": ["./skills"],
