## 4. 真名 4：plugin 安装目录 = `~/.openclaw/extensions/`（不是 `~/.openclaw/workspace/plugins/`）

### 4.1 原始命令

```bash
ls -la ~/.openclaw/workspace/plugins/ 2>&1
```

### 4.2 完整原始输出

```
ls: /Users/peterqiu/.openclaw/workspace/plugins/: No such file or directory
```

### 4.3 实证（本机已安装 plugin 列表）

#### 原始命令

```bash
openclaw plugins list
```

#### 完整原始输出（节选）

```
Config (/Users/peterqiu/.openclaw/openclaw.json): Materialized legacy per-surface agent ownership.
Config (/Users/peterqiu/.openclaw/openclaw.json): Removed retired agents.entries.*.default markers.
Plugins (51/69 enabled)
Source roots:
  stock: /Users/peterqiu/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/extensions

┌────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────┬──────────┬──────────┬────────────────────────────────┬──────────┐
│ Name                           │ ID                │ Format   │ Status   │ Source                         │ Version  │
├────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────┼──────────┼──────────┼────────────────────────────────┼──────────┤
│ A2A                            │ a2a               │ openclaw │ disabled │ stock:a2a/index.js             │ 2026.9.4 │
│ Active Memory                  │ active-memory     │ openclaw │ disabled │ stock:active-memory/index.js   │          │
│ @openclaw/admin-http-rpc       │ admin-http-rpc    │ openclaw │ disabled │ stock:admin-http-rpc/index.js  │ 2026.9.4 │
│ @openclaw/alibaba-provider     │ alibaba           │ openclaw │ enabled  │ stock:alibaba/index.js         │ 2026.9.4 │
│ Anthropic                      │ anthropic         │ openclaw │ enabled  │ stock:anthropic/index.js       │ 2026.9.4 │
...
```

### 4.4 来源

- 本机 `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`（真实存在的 plugin 配置入口）
- 本机 `~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/extensions`（stock plugin 根目录）
- 实证：本机**确实无** `~/.openclaw/workspace/plugins/` 目录（v1.0 调研报告错）

### 4.5 勘误对照

| 业界常写 | OpenClaw 真名 | 实证 |
|---|---|---|
| `~/.openclaw/workspace/plugins/` | **不存在** | 本机 ls 命令返回 "No such file or directory" |
| `~/.openclaw/extensions/`（用户装）| ✅ 真名 | Apify openclaw plugin README 实证 |
| `~/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/dist/extensions`（stock）| ✅ stock 根 | 本机实证 |

### 4.6 来源证据（Apify plugin README）

Apify openclaw plugin README 原文：

> "The script reads `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` (or `$OPENCLAW_CONFIG_PATH`), renames the `apify` id to `apify-openclaw-plugin` in `plugins.installs`, `plugins.entries`, `plugins.allow`, `plugins.deny`, and `plugins.slots.memory`, then writes the file back. It is safe to re-run."
>
> URL: https://github.com/apify/apify-openclaw-plugin

