## 6. 真名 6：ClawHub publish（独立 CLI · 走 GitHub OAuth）

### 6.1 原始证据（docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/quickstart）

#### 完整原始输出（节选关键段）

> "## Publish a plugin
>
> Publish a plugin from a local folder, a GitHub repo, a GitHub ref, or an existing archive:
>
> `clawhub package publish <source> --family code-plugin --dry-runclawhub package publish <source> --family code-plugin`
>
> Use `--dry-run` first to preview the resolved package metadata, compatibility fields, source attribution, and upload plan without publishing.
>
> `--dry-run`
>
> Use the `clawhub:` prefix when you want OpenClaw to resolve the package through ClawHub rather than npm or another source.
>
> `clawhub:`
>
> ## Sign in for publishing
>
> Install the ClawHub CLI:
>
> `npm i -g clawhub# orpnpm add -g clawhub`
>
> Sign in with GitHub:
>
> `clawhub loginclawhub whoami`"

#### URL

- `docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/quickstart`
- `docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/publishing`

### 6.2 GitHub 账号年龄约束（YouTube 官方教程）

> "your GitHub account must be at least 1 week old before you can publish to claw hub this is an anti-PAM measure so if you create a GitHub account today and try to publish immediately the publish will be rejected"

### 6.3 勘误对照

| 业界常写 | OpenClaw 真名 | 实证 |
|---|---|---|
| `openclaw plugins publish` | **`clawhub package publish`**（独立 CLI）| docs.openclaw.ai/clawhub/quickstart |
| `openclaw plugin registry` 上传 | **clawhub login + clawhub package publish** | 同上 |
| `openclaw plugin install` | **`openclaw plugins install clawhub:<package>`**（用户侧）| 同上 + docs.openclaw.ai/cli/plugins |

### 6.4 关键 trap

- ⚠ `clawhub` 是独立 npm 包（**不**与 `openclaw` 同包）；须 `npm i -g clawhub`
- ⚠ GitHub 账号 < 1 周直接被拒（反 PAM）
- ⚠ ClawHub 自动检查发布物，违反规范会被下架
- ⚠ private 仓库需 ClawHub GitHub App 授权（未来功能）

