## 7. 真名 7：`json5` 是 plugin runtime 必需依赖

### 7.1 原始证据（OpenClaw issue #77461）

#### URL

- `github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/77461`

#### Issue 摘要原文

> "## Summary
>
> `memory_search` failed with a missing `json5` package error from the generated OpenClaw plugin runtime dependency sandbox:
>
> `memory_search`
>
> `json5`
>
> `Cannot find package 'json5' imported from /Users/rodneyallrich/.openclaw/plugin-runtime-deps/openclaw-2026.5.3-1-da6bdffc3d96/dist/redact-1fZUZMlV.js
> Did you mean to import "json5/lib/index.js"?` [...] ## Current status
>
> After local sandbox repair and session restart, `memory_search` is working. The local workaround should become unnecessary once OpenClaw includes `json5` in the generated plugin runtime dependency set."

### 7.2 勘误对照

| 业界常写 | OpenClaw 真名 | 实证 |
|---|---|---|
| plugin 不需要 runtime dep | **`openclaw plugin-runtime-deps/` 沙盒机制** | issue #77461 实证 |
| `json5` 是可选 | **`json5` 是必需**（plugin 装 openclaw.plugin.json JSON5 必须）| issue #77461 "Cannot find package 'json5'" |
| 配置入口 = 标准 JSON | **JSON5 格式**（含注释/尾逗号）| 同上 |

