## 9. `openclaw plugins doctor` 实际输出

### 9.1 原始命令

```bash
openclaw plugins doctor
```

### 9.2 完整原始输出

```
[config] warnings: agents.entries: Materialized legacy per-surface agent ownership.; agents.entries: Removed retired agents.entries.*.default markers.
Plugin discovery, module loading, compatibility, and configuration checks passed. Run "openclaw health" to check the running Gateway, including runtime quarantines and fallbacks.
```

### 9.3 关键观察

- ✅ 27 个 stock plugin 全部 discovery + loading + compatibility + configuration 通过
- ⚠ 2 条 config warning（agents.entries 字段 Materialized + retired default markers removed）——是 OpenClaw 主程序主动 migrate 旧配置字段；不影响 plugin 本身

