```
Usage: openclaw plugins update [options] [id]

Update installed plugins and tracked hook packs

Arguments:
  id                                    Plugin or hook-pack id (omit with --all)

Options:
  --accept-capabilities                 Accept widened plugin capabilities
                                        (default: false)
  --acknowledge-install-policy-warning  Acknowledge security.installPolicy
                                        warnings without prompting; blocks and
                                        failures remain terminal (default: false)
  --all                                 Update all tracked plugins and hook
                                        packs (default: false)
  --dangerously-force-unsafe-install    Deprecated no-op; security.installPolicy
                                        may still block (default: false)
  --dry-run                             Show what would change without writing
                                        (default: false)
  -h, --help                            Display help for command
```

### 10.9 `plugins registry --help`

```
Usage: openclaw plugins registry [options]

Inspect or rebuild the persisted plugin registry

Options:
  -h, --help  Display help for command
  --json      Print JSON
  --refresh   Rebuild the persisted registry from current plugin manifests
              (default: false)
```

